WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.768
Hi, I'm Owlgebra.

00:00:04.968 --> 00:00:15.936
I help your child with homework, hints first and answers last. I help your child learn the steps, one hint at a time.

00:00:16.136 --> 00:00:23.696
For example, ask me: give my child a hint for this problem, not the answer.
